{
    "title": "Nice G.O.",
    "description": "The Nice G.O. Garage Door and Gate Operator app allows you to monitor and control your smart garage door opener(s) and/or gate openers(s) from anywhere.\r\n\r\nNo more worrying or wondering about whether you closed your garage door. The Nice G.O. app notifies you of who and when garage door was used, tracks activity history for your security and peace of mind.\r\n\r\n- View the status of your garage door\r\n- Open/Close your garage door\r\n- Invite guest users to have access to your door\r\n- Schedule automatic open/close & light on/off events (garage door openers only)\r\n- View all open/close activity for your door\r\n- View and monitor the status of the door\u2019s Wifi, & battery (if applicable).",
    "descriptionHTML": "The Nice G.O. Garage Door and Gate Operator app allows you to monitor and control your smart garage door opener(s) and/or gate openers(s) from anywhere.<br><br>No more worrying or wondering about whether you closed your garage door. The Nice G.O. app notifies you of who and when garage door was used, tracks activity history for your security and peace of mind.<br><br>- View the status of your garage door<br>- Open/Close your garage door<br>- Invite guest users to have access to your door<br>- Schedule automatic open/close &amp; light on/off events (garage door openers only)<br>- View all open/close activity for your door<br>- View and monitor the status of the door\u2019s Wifi, &amp; battery (if applicable).",
